# Starts at the Crossroads (hearthed there at the end of segment 5). The hearth stays bound
# at the Crossroads for the whole segment. Segment 4 already handed in its Crossroads and
# Ratchet quests (848, 880, 821, 863, 896, 902); the Barrens quests worked here (881, 867,
# 3281, 865, 1069) are taken in this segment. 3301 Mura Runetotem is carried on to segment 7.
# Ends at Sun Rock Retreat: train 20 in Thunder Bluff, then fly to Sun Rock to hand in
# Boulderslide Ravine. Segment 7 starts with Teleport: Undercity, which works from there.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Crossroads: pick up the quests for this segment
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
A 881 | Sergra Darkthorn. She gives you the Horn of Echeyakee
A 867 | Darsok Swiftdagger
A 3281 | Gazrog. The silver lies in a raptor nest at the Raptor Grounds; you get it on loop 2

